<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>JAYY VALLEY — 5LEAF SYNDICATE</title>

<style>

/* =========================================================
   JAYY VALLEY
   5LEAF SYNDICATE
   V3 — DARK MAGIC / URBAN / POWER
   ========================================================= */

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

:root {
    --black:#020203;
    --dark:#070709;
    --panel:#0d0d11;
    --panel2:#141419;

    --white:#f4f1e9;
    --gray:#aaa6a1;

    --gold:#d2b56f;
    --gold2:#ffe7a3;

    --red:#8d1823;
    --red2:#d52a38;

    --purple:#633e91;
    --purple2:#a66cff;

    --line:rgba(210,181,111,.20);
}

/* =========================================================
   RESET
   ========================================================= */

* {
    box-sizing:border-box;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body {
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% -10%,
            rgba(99,62,145,.25),
            transparent 32rem
        ),
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 85% 45%,
            rgba(141,24,35,.12),
            transparent 28rem
        ),
        #020203;

    color:var(--white);

    font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;

    line-height:1.6;

    overflow-x:hidden;
}

body::before {
    content:"";

    position:fixed;

    inset:0;

    pointer-events:none;

    z-index:999;

    opacity:.055;

    background-image:
        linear-gradient(
            rgba(255,255,255,.04) 1px,
            transparent 1px
        ),
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            rgba(255,255,255,.04) 1px,
            transparent 1px
        );

    background-size:50px 50px;

    mask-image:
        linear-gradient(
            to bottom,
            black,
            transparent 85%
        );
}

a {
    color:inherit;
    text-decoration:none;
}

button,
input {
    font-family:inherit;
}

.container {
    width:min(1150px,92%);
    margin:auto;
}

/* =========================================================
   NAV
   ========================================================= */

nav {
    position:fixed;

    top:0;
    left:0;
    right:0;

    z-index:100;

    background:
        rgba(2,2,3,.78);

    backdrop-filter:blur(18px);

    border-bottom:
        1px solid rgba(210,181,111,.16);
}

.nav-inner {
    min-height:72px;

    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    justify-content:space-between;

    gap:20px;
}

.brand {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    font-weight:900;

    letter-spacing:.17em;

    font-size:.9rem;
}

.brand span {
    color:var(--gold);
}

.nav-links {
    display:flex;

    gap:20px;

    flex-wrap:wrap;

    justify-content:flex-end;
}

.nav-links a {
    color:#aaa;

    font-size:.67rem;

    letter-spacing:.15em;

    text-transform:uppercase;

    transition:.25s ease;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
    color:var(--gold2);
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO
   ========================================================= */

.hero {
    min-height:100vh;

    position:relative;

    display:grid;

    place-items:center;

    text-align:center;

    padding:
        135px 0
        90px;

    overflow:hidden;
}

/* giant supernatural aura */

.hero::before {
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    width:700px;
    height:700px;

    border-radius:50%;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle,
            rgba(99,62,145,.16),
            rgba(141,24,35,.06) 38%,
            transparent 70%
        );

    filter:blur(10px);

    animation:
        auraPulse 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}

/* =========================================================
   ENERGY LINES
   ========================================================= */

.energy-ring {
    position:absolute;

    width:min(95vw,720px);

    aspect-ratio:1;

    border-radius:50%;

    border:
        1px solid rgba(210,181,111,.16);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 90px rgba(99,62,145,.12),
        inset 0 0 90px rgba(141,24,35,.07);

    animation:
        rotateRing 25s linear infinite;
}

.energy-ring::before {
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    inset:9%;

    border-radius:50%;

    border:
        1px dashed rgba(210,181,111,.18);

    animation:
        rotateReverse 16s linear infinite;
}

.energy-ring::after {
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    inset:22%;

    border-radius:50%;

    border:
        1px solid rgba(166,108,255,.13);

    transform:rotate(45deg);
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO CONTENT
   ========================================================= */

.hero-content {
    position:relative;

    z-index:10;
}

.eyebrow {
    color:var(--gold);

    font-size:.67rem;

    letter-spacing:.38em;

    text-transform:uppercase;

    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    font-size:
        clamp(3.8rem,13vw,9.2rem);

    line-height:.84;

    letter-spacing:.04em;

    text-shadow:
        0 0 35px rgba(210,181,111,.13);
}

.hero h1 span {
    color:var(--gold);
}

/* =========================================================
   5LEAF EMBLEM
   ========================================================= */

.clover-wrapper {
    width:270px;
    height:270px;

    margin:
        38px auto
        28px;

    position:relative;

    display:grid;

    place-items:center;
}

/* outer aura */

.clover-aura {
    position:absolute;

    width:250px;
    height:250px;

    border-radius:50%;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle,
            rgba(99,62,145,.13),
            transparent 68%
        );

    box-shadow:
        0 0 55px rgba(166,108,255,.12);

    animation:
        auraPulse 3.8s ease-in-out infinite;
}

/* =========================================================
   FIVE LEAF
   ========================================================= */

.five-leaf {
    position:relative;

    width:185px;
    height:185px;

    animation:
        cloverSpin 18s linear infinite;

    filter:
        drop-shadow(
            0 0 14px
            rgba(210,181,111,.20)
        );

    transition:.5s ease;
}

.clover-wrapper:hover .five-leaf {
    animation-duration:3s;

    filter:
        drop-shadow(
            0 0 24px
            rgba(210,181,111,.55)
        );
}

/* =========================================================
   LEAVES
   ========================================================= */

.leaf {
    position:absolute;

    width:70px;
    height:88px;

    left:57px;
    top:48px;

    border-radius:
        68% 32% 65% 35%;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            var(--gold2),
            var(--gold) 42%,
            #60491f
        );

    border:
        1px solid
        rgba(255,235,170,.58);

    box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 18px
        rgba(255,255,255,.09),

        0 0 13px
        rgba(210,181,111,.13);

    transform-origin:
        50% 100%;
}

/* five original positions */

.leaf.one {
    transform:
        rotate(0deg)
        translateY(-54px);
}

.leaf.two {
    transform:
        rotate(72deg)
        translateY(-54px);
}

.leaf.three {
    transform:
        rotate(144deg)
        translateY(-54px);
}

.leaf.four {
    transform:
        rotate(216deg)
        translateY(-54px);
}

.leaf.five {
    transform:
        rotate(288deg)
        translateY(-54px);
}

/* veins */

.leaf::after {
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    left:50%;

    top:12px;

    width:1px;

    height:63px;

    transform:
        translateX(-50%)
        rotate(-9deg);

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            transparent,
            rgba(255,247,213,.72),
            transparent
        );
}

/* =========================================================
   CENTER 5
   ========================================================= */

.clover-five {
    position:absolute;

    z-index:20;

    width:68px;
    height:68px;

    display:grid;

    place-items:center;

    border-radius:50%;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle,
            #21190c,
            #060606 70%
        );

    border:
        2px solid
        var(--gold2);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 25px
        rgba(210,181,111,.45),

        inset 0 0 20px
        rgba(210,181,111,.16);

    animation:
        fivePulse 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.clover-five span {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    color:var(--gold2);

    font-size:2.15rem;

    font-weight:900;

    text-shadow:
        0 0 15px
        rgba(255,231,163,.7);
}

/* =========================================================
   POWER-UP EFFECT
   ========================================================= */

.power-aura {
    position:absolute;

    width:190px;
    height:190px;

    border-radius:50%;

    border:
        1px solid
        rgba(166,108,255,.20);

    opacity:.6;

    animation:
        powerSpin 8s linear infinite;
}

.power-aura::before,
.power-aura::after {
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    width:6px;
    height:6px;

    border-radius:50%;

    background:var(--gold2);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 14px var(--gold2);
}

.power-aura::before {
    top:-3px;
    left:50%;
}

.power-aura::after {
    bottom:-3px;
    right:20%;
}

/* =========================================================
   PARTICLES
   ========================================================= */

.particle {
    position:absolute;

    width:4px;
    height:4px;

    border-radius:50%;

    background:var(--gold2);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 12px
        var(--gold2);

    opacity:.65;

    animation:
        particleFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.p1 {
    left:17%;
    top:34%;
}

.p2 {
    left:80%;
    top:30%;
    animation-delay:1s;
}

.p3 {
    left:12%;
    top:67%;
    animation-delay:2s;
}

.p4 {
    left:84%;
    top:65%;
    animation-delay:3s;
}

.p5 {
    left:50%;
    top:16%;
    animation-delay:1.5s;
}

.p6 {
    left:65%;
    top:75%;
    animation-delay:2.5s;
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO TEXT
   ========================================================= */

.hero h2 {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    font-size:
        clamp(1rem,3vw,1.75rem);

    letter-spacing:.19em;

    margin-bottom:12px;
}

.hero h2 span {
    color:var(--gold);
}

.hero p {
    max-width:680px;

    margin:auto;

    color:var(--gray);

    font-size:.96rem;
}

.cta-row {
    display:flex;

    justify-content:center;

    gap:12px;

    flex-wrap:wrap;

    margin-top:30px;
}

.btn {
    display:inline-block;

    padding:
        13px 23px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--gold);

    font-size:.68rem;

    font-weight:800;

    letter-spacing:.13em;

    text-transform:uppercase;

    transition:.25s ease;
}

.btn.primary {
    background:var(--gold);

    color:#050505;
}

.btn.secondary {
    border-color:#555;

    color:#ddd;
}

.btn:hover {
    transform:translateY(-3px);

    box-shadow:
        0 10px 30px
        rgba(0,0,0,.4);
}

/* =========================================================
   SECTIONS
   ========================================================= */

section {
    padding:
        105px 0;
}

.section-head {
    max-width:780px;

    margin-bottom:42px;
}

.kicker {
    color:var(--gold);

    font-size:.67rem;

    letter-spacing:.3em;

    text-transform:uppercase;

    margin-bottom:11px;
}

.section-head h2 {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    font-size:
        clamp(2rem,5vw,3.7rem);

    line-height:1.05;
}

.section-head p {
    color:var(--gray);

    margin-top:16px;
}

/* =========================================================
   PANELS
   ========================================================= */

.panel {
    position:relative;

    overflow:hidden;

    border:
        1px solid var(--line);

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            rgba(255,255,255,.035),
            rgba(255,255,255,.008)
        );

    padding:30px;

    transition:
        transform .3s ease,
        border-color .3s ease;
}

.panel::before {
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    width:120px;
    height:120px;

    right:-60px;
    top:-60px;

    border:
        1px solid
        rgba(210,181,111,.13);

    border-radius:50%;
}

.panel:hover {
    transform:translateY(-4px);

    border-color:
        rgba(210,181,111,.42);
}

.grid {
    display:grid;

    gap:18px;
}

.grid-2 {
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
}

.grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
}

.grid-5 {
    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));
}

/* =========================================================
   FIVE SYNS
   ========================================================= */

.syn {
    min-height:205px;

    display:flex;

    flex-direction:column;

    justify-content:space-between;
}

.syn .number {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    color:var(--gold);

    font-size:1.8rem;
}

.syn h3 {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    letter-spacing:.1em;

    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.syn p {
    color:var(--gray);

    font-size:.87rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   ABOUT
   ========================================================= */

.about-copy {
    max-width:820px;

    color:#d0ccc5;

    font-size:1.08rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   MUSIC
   ========================================================= */

.music-card {
    min-height:245px;
}

.music-card h3,
.coming h3 {
    font-family:Cinzel,serif;

    font-size:1.35rem;

    letter-spacing:.1em;

    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.tag {
    display:inline-block;

    color:var(--gold);

    border:
        1px solid
        rgba(210,181,111,.35);

    padding:
        5px 9px;

    font-size:.62rem;

    letter-spacing:.15em;

    text-transform:uppercase;

    margin-bottom:20px;
}

/* =========================================================
   COMING SOON
   ========================================================= */

.coming {
    min-height:260px;

    display:flex;

    flex-direction:column;

    justify-content:center;
}

.coming strong {
    color:var(--gold);

    font-size:.68rem;

    letter-spacing:.2em;

    text-transform:uppercase;

    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.muted {
    color:var(--gray);
}

/* =========================================================
   JOIN
   ========================================================= */

.join {
    text-align:center;

    padding:
        80px 25px;

    border:
        1px solid
        rgba(210,181,111,.3);

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% 0%,
            rgba(99,62,145,.20),
            transparent 60%
        ),

        #09090b;
}

.join p {
    max-width:650px;

    margin:
        15px auto;

    color:var(--gray);
}

.form {
    max-width:560px;

    margin:
        28px auto 0;

    display:flex;

    gap:8px;
}

.form input {
    flex:1;

    min-width:0;

    background:#050505;

    border:
        1px solid #444;

    color:white;

    padding:
        14px 15px;

    outline:none;
}

.form input:focus {
    border-color:var(--gold);
}

.form button {
    border:
        1px solid var(--gold);

    background:var(--gold);

    color:#050505;

    padding:
        0 22px;

    font-weight:800;

    cursor:pointer;
}

.form-message {
    margin-top:14px;

    color:var(--gold);

    font-size:.82rem;

    min-height:1.4em;
}

/* =========================================================
   FOOTER
   ========================================================= */

footer {
    border-top:
        1px solid var(--line);

    padding:
        35px 0;

    color:#777;

    font-size:.72rem;
}

.footer-inner {
    display:flex;

    justify-content:space-between;

    gap:20px;

    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

footer strong {
    color:#aaa;
}

/* =========================================================
   ANIMATIONS
   ========================================================= */

@keyframes cloverSpin {

    from {
        transform:rotate(0deg);
    }

    to {
        transform:rotate(360deg);
    }

}

@keyframes rotateRing {

    from {
        transform:rotate(0deg);
    }

    to {
        transform:rotate(360deg);
    }

}

@keyframes rotateReverse {

    from {
        transform:rotate(360deg);
    }

    to {
        transform:rotate(0deg);
    }

}

@keyframes powerSpin {

    from {
        transform:rotate(0deg) scale(1);
    }

    50% {
        transform:rotate(180deg) scale(1.08);
    }

    to {
        transform:rotate(360deg) scale(1);
    }

}

@keyframes auraPulse {

    0%,
    100% {
        transform:scale(.96);

        opacity:.45;
    }

    50% {
        transform:scale(1.08);

        opacity:.9;
    }

}

@keyframes fivePulse {

    0%,
    100% {
        transform:scale(1);

        box-shadow:
            0 0 20px
            rgba(210,181,111,.3),

            inset 0 0 20px
            rgba(210,181,111,.1);
    }

    50% {
        transform:scale(1.08);

        box-shadow:
            0 0 42px
            rgba(210,181,111,.65),

            0 0 70px
            rgba(99,62,145,.25),

            inset 0 0 25px
            rgba(210,181,111,.2);
    }

}

@keyframes particleFloat {

    0% {
        transform:
            translateY(0)
            scale(.7);

        opacity:.15;
    }

    50% {
        transform:
            translateY(-40px)
            scale(1.5);

        opacity:1;
    }

    100% {
        transform:
            translateY(0)
            scale(.7);

        opacity:.15;
    }

}

/* =========================================================
   MOBILE
   ========================================================= */

@media(max-width:800px) {

    .nav-inner {
        padding:
            14px 0;

        align-items:
            flex-start;
    }

    .nav-links {
        gap:10px;
    }

    .grid-2,
    .grid-3,
    .grid-5 {
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    section {
        padding:
            75px 0;
    }

    .hero {
        padding-top:
            145px;
    }

    .clover-wrapper {
        transform:
            scale(.86);
    }

    .energy-ring {
        width:115vw;
    }

    .form {
        flex-direction:column;
    }

    .form button {
        padding:
            14px;
    }

}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- ======================================================
     NAVIGATION
     ====================================================== -->

<nav>

<div class="container nav-inner">

<a class="brand" href="#top">
JAYY <span>VALLEY</span>
</a>

<div class="nav-links">

<a href="#syndicate">
Syndicate
</a>

<a href="#music">
Music
</a>

<a href="#books">
Books
</a>

<a href="#media">
Media
</a>

<a href="#fiveleaf">
5LEAF
</a>

<a href="#join">
Join
</a>

</div>

</div>

</nav>


<!-- ======================================================
     HERO
     ====================================================== -->

<main id="top">

<section class="hero">


<div class="energy-ring"></div>


<div class="particle p1"></div>
<div class="particle p2"></div>
<div class="particle p3"></div>
<div class="particle p4"></div>
<div class="particle p5"></div>
<div class="particle p6"></div>


<div class="hero-content container">


<div class="eyebrow">
JAYY VALLEY — THE ARCHIVE OPENS
</div>


<h1>

JAYY

<br>

<span>VALLEY</span>

</h1>


<!-- =====================================================
     5LEAF POWER SYMBOL
     ===================================================== -->

<div class="clover-wrapper">


<div class="clover-aura"></div>


<div class="power-aura"></div>


<div class="five-leaf">

<div class="leaf one"></div>

<div class="leaf two"></div>

<div class="leaf three"></div>

<div class="leaf four"></div>

<div class="leaf five"></div>

</div>


<div class="clover-five">

<span>5</span>

</div>


</div>


<h2>

WELCOME TO THE

<span>
5LEAF SYNDICATE
</span>

</h2>


<p>

A creative world built around music,
stories, visuals, ideas and the people
who choose to grow with it.

</p>


<div class="cta-row">


<a
class="btn primary"
href="#syndicate"
>
ENTER THE SYNDICATE
</a>


<a
class="btn secondary"
href="#music"
>
EXPLORE THE MUSIC
</a>


</div>


</div>

</section>


<!-- ======================================================
     SYNDICATE
     ====================================================== -->

<section id="syndicate">

<div class="container">


<div class="section-head">

<div class="kicker">
01 / THE SYNDICATE
</div>

<h2>
WELCOME TO THE SYNDICATE.
</h2>

<p>

The 5LEAF Syndicate is the community
around Jayy Valley — supporters,
listeners, readers and creators connected
by the same hunger to create, remember,
evolve, protect and believe.

</p>

</div>


<div class="grid grid-5">


<article class="panel syn">

<div class="number">
I
</div>

<div>

<h3>
CREATE
</h3>

<p>
Make something from the ideas
living in your head.
</p>

</div>

</article>


<article class="panel syn">

<div class="number">
II
</div>

<div>

<h3>
REMEMBER
</h3>

<p>
Keep the past without letting
it control the future.
</p>

</div>

</article>


<article class="panel syn">

<div class="number">
III
</div>

<div>

<h3>
EVOLVE
</h3>

<p>
Growth is part of the story.
Never stay still.
</p>

</div>

</article>


<article class="panel syn">

<div class="number">
IV
</div>

<div>

<h3>
PROTECT
</h3>

<p>
Protect your people,
your vision and your purpose.
</p>

</div>

</article>


<article class="panel syn">

<div class="number">
V
</div>

<div>

<h3>
BELIEVE
</h3>

<p>
Move before the world
gives you permission.
</p>

</div>

</article>


</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- ======================================================
     ABOUT
     ====================================================== -->

<section id="about">

<div class="container">


<div class="section-head">

<div class="kicker">
02 / GET TO KNOW ME
</div>

<h2>
THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORLD.
</h2>

</div>


